WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.054 --> 00:00:08.117
Tennis camp didn't get any easier as the week wore on.

2
00:00:08.118 --> 00:00:17.022
After days of hitting the ball to herself against the practice wall, Iris paired up with Javier on Friday.

3
00:00:17.022 --> 00:00:25.021
The two of them had improved but just barely. Iris felt like a dismal failure at tennis so far.

4
