At least it's Friday, she told herself. The last day of being grounded.

5
00:00:30.742 --> 00:00:36.273
Tomorrow she could finally get back to the park and play soccer with her friends.

6
00:00:36.273 --> 00:00:44.960
Just then Javier launched the ball to Iris, snapping her out of her thoughts. Without thinking, she swung. And

7
00:00:44.962 --> 00:00:51.495
missed. Iris groaned. "Iris!"

8
00:00:51.495 --> 00:01:01.154
Ally appeared behind her. "What's going on, girlfriend? That is not how I taught you to swing." "I

9
00:01:01.155 --> 00:01:05.993
was thinking about soccer," Iris admitted. "Soccer."

10
00:01:05.994 --> 00:01:11.056
Javier rolled his eyes from across the net. "When

