hit it back. Iris focused. She watched the ball, holding her racket steady as Ally had shown her. She

15
00:01:40.874 --> 00:01:48.524
swung, and with a delicate ping , her racket sent the ball flying back to Javier again.

16
00:01:48.525 --> 00:01:51.392
He returned it to her.

17
00:01:51.393 --> 00:01:54.045
