72
00:08:00.575 --> 00:08:07.059
Iris slinked off the court, Javier at her heels.

73
00:08:07.060 --> 00:08:17.467
She knew she'd acted like a sore loser, but Javier had made it worse by embarrassing her in front of everyone, especially Jae.

74
00:08:17.467 --> 00:08:23.544
"You need to chill," Javier muttered. "It's just a game." "I

75
